// The opening beat of a synthetic sample script.
Narrator: The lamp above the desk flickers. #line:1a0001 #atmosphere
Ada: You came back. #line:1a0002
/// How many times the player has spoken to Ada.
<<declare $visits = 0>>
<<set $visits += 1>>
Ada: Visit number {$visits}, and still no apology. #line:1a0003
-> I brought the ledger. #line:1a0004
    Ada: Then we can finally balance it. #line:1a0005
    <<jump Ledger>>
-> I brought nothing. #line:1a0006
    Ada: [wave]Empty handed[/wave], as usual. #line:1a0007 #mocking
    -> That was a difficult year.
        Ada: It was a difficult decade. #line:1a0008
    -> Let us not discuss it.
        <<jump Ledger>>
-> Leave before she notices. <<if $visits > 3>> #line:1a0009
    <<stop>>
===

title: Ledger
tags:
---
Ada: Column after column, and every one of them wrong. #line:1b0001
<<if $visits == 0>>
    Ada: You have never been here before. #line:1b0002
<<elseif $visits < 3>>
    Ada: A handful of visits, and still no progress. #line:1b0003
<<else>>
    Ada: You know this room as well as I do. #line:1b0004
<<endif>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
Ada: We start again from the top. #line:1b0005
<<jump Start>>
===
